        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13654.txt",
        "text_sha256": "277e1072608fd9111c6ad487b7c1bea43ff1bf74cea9b0293361329483c84673",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2013-11-26/pdf/2013-28581.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (Board). There is established, \neffective 12:01 a.m. eastern standard time on November 22, 2013, a Board \nof three members to be appointed by the President to investigate and report \non these disputes. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested \nin any organization of railroad employees or any carrier. The Board shall \nperform its functions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2262,
      "char_start": 2145,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13654#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13654#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "78 FR 70843, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "35e7d15aa65691322a1ff7405228c3c3f21c2ef790186d42042a773599ecabab",
        "signing_date": "2013-11-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13654.txt",
        "text_sha256": "277e1072608fd9111c6ad487b7c1bea43ff1bf74cea9b0293361329483c84673",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2013-11-26/pdf/2013-28581.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to \nthe disputes within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2541,
      "char_start": 2264,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13654#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
