      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Records Maintenance. The records and files of the Board are records \nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’s termination shall be \nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board. \nVerDate Mar<15>2010 18:57 Nov 25, 2013 Jkt 232001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4790 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\26NOE0.SGM 26NOE0maindgalligan on DSK5VPTVN1PROD with RULES\n=== PDF page 2 of 3 ===\n70844 Federal Register / Vol. 78, No. 228 / Tuesday, November 26, 2013 / Presidential Documents"
